{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2021-11-22 17:04:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION ANNOUNCES 56TH CONSECUTIVE INCREASE TO ANNUAL DIVIDEND', 'text': 'AUSTIN, MINN., NOV. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION (NYSE: HRL), A GLOBAL BRANDED FOOD COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED A 6 PERCENT INCREASE TO THE ANNUAL DIVIDEND TO SHAREHOLDERS, MARKING THE 56TH CONSECUTIVE ANNUAL DIVIDEND INCREASE.'}